WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.510
Skilled chefs from all over the country

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.180
are competing against each other

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:39.600
in order to become

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.250
the Super Chef.

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:44.000
This year’s test

00:01:44.050 --> 00:01:45.740
is to make Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.240
I can’t make my Unparalleled Scholar Noodles

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.330
without that rock.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.390
Meili had gone back to get it

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:54.870
but she hasn’t returned.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.760
If she comes back quickly,

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:01.060
there might still be enough time.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:03.510
Hurry up, Meili!

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.310
Please, I can’t be late!

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.450
Ultimate Skill Unparalleled Scholar Noodles

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:20.090
(Noodles Unparalleled Scholar Noodles)on

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:23.600
(Noodles)

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:24.790
Finished!

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:27.380
Judges, please take a look.

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:32.780
So soon?

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:34.200
Who is it?

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.380
Oh, no, it’s Han of Dongjiang Restaurant!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.220
But Han,

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:52.010
I’m afraid

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.810
I don’t see any noodles.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:55.140
Give me a minute.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.180
I’m gonna put them in the bowls.

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:02.730
What is he doing?

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:11.260
Seriously?

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:21.620
Working Double Blades in the air?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:35.490
Unbelievable!

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.960
Please, judges.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.230
Quite an overpowering smell!

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:00.380
A thick layer of oil

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:02.470
is on the surface.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.240
His noodles

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:12.520
are driving out

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.900
mighty power inside me!

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:17.180
The soup is rich and flavorful.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.780
He must've used cattle, pig and chicken bones

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:20.770
and boiled them for hours to make the stock.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.460
It’s more like eating

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.390
than sipping.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.250
The dough is properly kneaded

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:27.850
and the noodles are chewy.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.560
I’ve never had anything like that.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.590
The simple seasoning

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.510
goes surprisingly well with the soup.

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.780
Han, let me ask you something.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.260
What makes your noodles to be Unparalleled Scholar Noodles?

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.720
The soup is condensed

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.730
from the stock

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.620
made of all kinds of bones.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.490
The noodles come from a thousand times of kneading.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:52.990
So, whoever has my noodles,

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.010
no matter how weak he is,

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.280
will become a hero of unparalleled scholar!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.130
So, what do you say?

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.410
Han of Dongjiang Restaurant has passed!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.260
That’s one pass

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:12.700
out of five already.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.260
He’s good!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.300
Meili, where are you?

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.500
Mao!

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.610
Meili!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.710
Sorry, I’m late.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:25.540
Meili!

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.070
Someone has passed the test already?

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:30.080
I’m so sorry. It's all my fault.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.250
Don’t worry.

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:34.030
Now that I’ve got this, everything will be OK.

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:35.040
Anyway,

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:36.340
what on earth is this rock?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:42.850
Mao!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:44.520
Why do you need it so bad

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.580
for your cooking?

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:47.510
Mao!

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:50.730
This rock

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.070
will turn into Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.130
Noodles made of a rock?

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.360
Are you crazy?

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:01.480
Now, put everything into the boiling water

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.240
and give it some time,

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.580
then my Unparalleled Scholar Noodles
will be done.

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.460
Others look even more serious.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.180
They must be finishing their cooking now!

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:20.690
Only Mao

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:21.930
is still playing with that rock!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.260
We're running out of time!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.110
Tang of Bancai Restaurant has passed!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:33.500
I made Eight-virtue Noodles.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.690
(Benevolence)

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:40.350
(Loyalty)

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.570
The eight toppings

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.150
(Bravery Propriety Loyalty Benevolence Righteousness Trust
Filialness Wisdom) are carved with those eight virtues,

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:50.320
correct?

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:51.290
Precisely.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:55.520
For those to be Unparalleled Scholar,

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.760
eight virtues are a must,

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:57.660
namely

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:03.270
benevolence, loyalty, propriety, bravery,
wisdom, filialness, trust, righteousness.

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.650
The taste is out of this world

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:08.150
and your knife skills are unrivaled.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.740
Good job, Tang!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:11.830
He’s as good as they said.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:13.510
A young man like him

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.430
is already

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.560
as skilled

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:16.630
as Chef Zhou Yu of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:17.720
I agree.

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:19.400
Two spots have been taken.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.360
Only three of you can pass the past,

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.070
Mao!

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:24.000
I know. I’ll definitely be one of them!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.380
That’s the spirit!

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.100
Is that raw wheat in the pot?

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:29.870
You haven’t ground it?

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:31.370
I’m roasting it slightly

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.210
before grinding.

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.110
That way,

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.250
the dried wheat

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.680
will smell even better.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.280
Why are you doing it now?

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.370
Clock is ticking!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.000
You should’ve jumped on it

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.500
before coming here.

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:46.390
No, I’m going to use

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:47.390
the freshly ground flour.

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:49.220
Next, I’m making the dough.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.880
Finally, you’ve started it.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.560
Make a hole in the center

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:58.570
and put eggs in it.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:07:59.950
Here’s water.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.080
You need it to make the dough, right?

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:01.670
Hold it!

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.070
My dough doesn’t need any water.

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.520
That’s how I make my Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.860
What? Are you serious?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:10.790
Flour and eggs

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:11.780
can only become little balls

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.560
if you do it like this.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.410
No way!

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.060
It won’t turn into noodles!

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:20.340
Just wait for it.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.110
My noodles will be Unparalleled Scholar Noodles,

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:22.680
Meili.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.750
Stop bragging!

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:25.770
Can you even finish in time?

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:29.580
Che Lin has passed!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.760
That woman Che Lin

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:34.710
is known as Ryuuri Witch

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.570
in the cooking circle in Guangzhou.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:41.480
My noodles are called Wild Taste.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:49.920
I used snakes, frogs, rabbits,

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:53.350
pheasants, scorpions, bats, etc.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:56.660
They’re all Guangzhou’s specials.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.540
A one-of-a-kind figure in the country

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.000
deserves more than an ordinary dish.

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:04.150
Only food

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:05.330
with the wildest taste

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.580
can be served to a hero of unparalleled scholar.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:08.770
Am I right?

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.700
You combined noodles

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:13.350
with the unusual choices of meat.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:17.060
Only a cooking witch

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:17.810
like you

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.390
can pull it through flawlessly.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:21.770
No doubt,

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:22.980
you’ve passed, Che Lin.

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.730
Thank you, judges.

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:27.130
Only two spots left

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.120
but we still don’t have a proper dough.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:35.980
Chef Pai,

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:39.610
the so-called

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.120
toughest cooking test in the country

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:42.880
won’t stop me.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:43.830
I’ll follow in your steps!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.890
Only two more will get the pass.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.980
How come they’re still so quiet?

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:52.230
What’s Genius Fei waiting for?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.130
Finally, Fei is taking action.

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:06.440
It’s Fei!

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.050
Guys, Genius Fei is making his noodles.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.450
So, that’s Fei?

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:15.120
Is he cooking?

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.410
It’s like dancing

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.290
more than cooking.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.940
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:10.810
Impressive!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.830
Noodles are getting thinner and thinner.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.250
They aren’t noodles but strings.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.740
Like the finniest silk!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.070
Usually, noodles can only be stretched

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:23.870
10 times at most.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.760
They can’t go any thinner than that.

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:26.710
But Fei

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.410
has done 20 times.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:29.970
What? 20 times?

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:32.800
Those extremely thin noodles

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.700
can only be made by Genius Fei.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.080
It’s a miracle!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:50.400
He’s frying the noodles.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.350
He’s frying them at a low temperature

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.540
instead of boiling them because they’d break in the water.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:00.670
My dish is complete, judges.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.980
Sir, could this be...?

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.230
Exactly.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.890
They’re but the legendary

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.630
Dragon Whisker Noodles

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.050
made in the Ming Dynasty.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.260
Similar to a dragon’s whiskers,

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:39.360
they're as thin as hair.

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.040
Few in China

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.550
can still make that dish.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.990
And he did it at such a young age!

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:58.600
They're melting in my mouth.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.870
What a tender and beautiful texture!

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.110
The red and white powder is sugar.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:07.220
He’s turned noodles into a dessert.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.200
It’s got a flowery aroma, too.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:11.520
What is...?

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:14.590
Turns out, judges of the Super Chef Test

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.410
are only mediocre.

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:18.490
What did you say, brat?

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:19.520
It’s lotus.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.420
What? Lotus?

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.890
The flowery aroma

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:24.620
comes from lotus.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:28.440
I wrapped the dough with a lotus leaf

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.000
and let it rest for hours.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:31.640
That explains it.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.270
The fragrant aroma

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:35.720
actually came from lotus leaves.

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:36.720
I got it.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.400
It was a lotus leaf

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:41.290
that Fei used to wrap up his dough.

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:43.690
Alright.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.030
Your noodles taste good,

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:46.880
but that alone

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.900
won’t qualify you to pass the test.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:52.300
Your dish looks like something a woman would made.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:54.920
It failed to serve today’s theme.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.770
What he made

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.500
is the exact opposite

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.000
of unparalleled scholar.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:01.310
Yes.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.560
Fei, please explain to me

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:09.180
what makes your noodles to be Unparalleled Scholar Noodles.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.270
My noodles

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:12.970
represent beauties,

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.180
or the fairest women.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:16.720
The fairest women!

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.520
The fairest women?

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.180
The fairest... women...?

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:22.740
It’s a long-standing tradition

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.450
in our country

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:27.300
to call the groom “unparalleled scholar”

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.080
and the bride “the fairest”.

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:32.460
As a couple,

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:35.360
the man of unparalleled scholar and the fairest woman

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.420
are inseparable.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:37.680
It makes sense.

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:40.130
The fairest woman is a unique angle.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.510
Lan Feihong has passed!

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:47.430
Fei is the fourth chef to pass the Test.

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:49.650
He’s incredible!

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.180
A real genius!

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.090
No wonder he could make Dragon Whisker Noodles.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.000
His reputation is well-deserved.

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:59.110
Fei seems distant

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.820
but why was he so nice to me

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:01.770
as to help me that much?

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:03.770
Meaning no one else

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:05.360
in the country was his match.

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.460
He also enlightened me about the theme.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.010
Whenever you’re lost,

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:12.560
think about your inspiration for cooking.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.740
And he gave me advice.

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:16.430
Who exactly is he?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.570
Get your head in the game!

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.160
We’re down to one last spot!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.490
Are your noodles still not cooked, Mao?

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:24.250
I got it!

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:27.720
Will he make it?

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.860
The dough is good enough

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.550
and so is the pot over there.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.860
All those little pieces of the rock

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:38.600
have sunk to the bottom.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.340
The muddy water

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:42.010
has become so pure, Mao!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.400
The pure liquid

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:46.700
is the key.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.660
I’m sprinkling this liquid on the dough.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:52.580
Why is this liquid

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:53.750
so important?

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:54.770
You’ll find out later.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.180
That liquid...

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.140
I can’t do it.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:24.680
Even if I boiled the noodles,

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:27.000
they'd be irrelevant to the theme.

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:28.850
Damn it!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.340
I’m not good enough.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:32.570
They’ve set the bar too high this year.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:41.600
Almost done.

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:43.290
Once it’s finished,

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:44.930
no way would I lose!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:46.510
The last spot

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:49.180
is going to me, Wang Hu of Shaolin Restaurant!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.860
Even those who're considered skilled

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:53.190
are giving up

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.370
and going home.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.850
It’s understandable.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:59.560
There’s only one spot

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:00.780
and little time left.

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.040
Alright, this will do.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:09.540
Let’s stretch it.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.410
Meili, hold that side tight.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:16.780
But Mao...

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:19.460
Does that kid know what he’s doing?

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.880
Yeah, you can’t stretch a dough

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:22.990
made without water.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.040
It’ll snap for sure.

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:25.970
No doubt about that!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.910
I can’t believe he’s here for the Test

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:30.890
without knowing the basics.

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:34.930
Let’s do it, Meili!

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.180
Really?

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:36.940
Don't blame me

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.200
if anything goes wrong.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:47.120
Behold! My Unparalleled Scholar Noodles!

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:50.800
See?

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.700
It's going!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.860
Not yet, not yet!

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:56.420
Unbelievable!

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:57.760
You’re amazing, Mao!

00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:58.640
How could

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:00.330
a waterless dough

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.510
go that long?

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:03.710
I knew it. It was that liquid.

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.770
Stop. That’s about right.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.070
Meili, let go!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.980
Ready? Hands off!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.170
They're drawing back themselves!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:25.350
How is that even possible?

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.930
Look, I’m kneading them

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.450
while separating them into a few portions.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.010
All done.

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:32.930
The last step is to cook them.

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.330
Don’t forget the soup!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.940
Hurry, no time to waste!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.810
My noodles need no soup.

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.410
Noodles without any soup?

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.500
Heat some lard,

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.500
add scallion, garlic,

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.680
ginger, chili and other spices

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.680
and mix everything with boiled noodles.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.690
Come on, Mao!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.810
Is it done? Still no?

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.020
How long, Mao?

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:19.970
Finished!

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.590
It’s done!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.390
Really?

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.330
You did it!

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:29.820
Wait!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.470
It’s too soon to celebrate.

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:32.960
Raise your hand now!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.280
You’re right.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.150
Ouch!

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.190
Raise the hand!

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:41.810
Judges, I've finished.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.520
My dish is done, judges!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.080
Here, here, here!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:54.830
Judges, we've raised the hand!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.220
Wang Hu beat you to it.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:57.520
You were after him.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:00.450
No way!

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:03.610
We’ll examine the dish made by

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:05.670
Wang Hu of Shaolin Restaurant first.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:06.550
We’re doomed!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:08.180
What did you do?

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.850
You idiot, idiot, idiot!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:12.390
Calling me names is of no use, Meili!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:13.770
Silence!

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.960
Yes, sir.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:21.140
We’ll start with Wang Hu of Shaolin Restaurant.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.020
Delicacies from land and sea,

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.180
plus thick slices of char siu.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.290
That’s a feast in a bowl.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.160
It’s... it’s not char siu!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.850
Its enchanting aroma

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.490
and the tender texture...

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.150
It’s Dongpo Pork

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.960
made with a whole pork belly.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:43.390
No wonder.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.370
The saltness and sweetness are well-balanced.

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:48.100
The braised pork tastes even better than char siu.

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.080
All those delicacies and Dongpo Pork

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.970
are extravagant

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:54.770
and they’ve taken the flavor to a whole new level.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.620
So, Wang Hu,

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.670
what makes your noodles

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:01.250
unparalleled?

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:02.320
As you all know,

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.390
Dongpo Pork

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.160
was created by the great politician

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.010
and poet of the Song Dynasty, Su Dongpo.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:09.850
He once said,

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:13.670
“Time is more precious than gold”.

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:16.820
Su Dongpo, as a poet,

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.570
was doubtlessly unparalleled scholar!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.340
He’s right.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.060
His dish

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.200
also matches the theme seamlessly.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.850
I guess he’ll be the fifth one.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:29.410
Meili, he’s exceptional!

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:31.380
This is not the time to be marveled.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.840
The last spot is going to me.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:44.820
We've made our decision...

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:18.986
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.986 --> 00:23:21.399
Oh, I was just one step away.

00:23:21.399 --> 00:23:27.196
Can't mom even let me see the legendary cooking arena
where Zhou Yu once challenged?

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:29.157
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.157 --> 00:23:31.993
Final Battle! The Legendary Cooking Arena

00:23:31.993 --> 00:23:33.453
It will definitely be interesting!
